"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1) Go to Settings\n"
"2) Go to Users & Companies\n"
"3) Choose the User whose logs you need to see and go to Authentication\n"
"   logs\n"
"4) You will see a list of authentications for a specific user\n"
"\n"
